{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","page-layout":"full"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ════════════════════════ ABOUT HERO ═════════════════════════════ -->\n<section class=\"about-hero\">\n  <div class=\"about-grid\">\n\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"profile-img\" src=\"img/profile.jpg\" alt=\"Mathias Lauber\" onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=\\'profile-placeholder\\'>👤</div>'\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"hero-badge\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">Data Professional · Switzerland</div>\n      <div class=\"about-name\">Mathias Lauber</div>\n      <div class=\"about-role\">Data &amp; Insights Analyst @ World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA)</div>\n      <p class=\"about-bio\">\n        I'm a data professional based in Switzerland, specialising in transforming complex data into\n        actionable insights, robust products, and compelling visual stories. At the Swiss Federal Statistical Office,\n        I sat at the intersection of engineering, analysis, and design — building the infrastructure that powers\n        federal statistics, and crafting the visualizations that communicate them to the public.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"about-bio\">\n        My background gives me a strong quantitative foundation and a spatial perspective on data problems.\n        Over the years, I've expanded into data engineering (Databricks, PySpark, ETL pipelines),\n        BI products (semantic models, data catalogs, Streamlit apps), machine learning, and data community\n        management — always with a focus on usability and impact.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"about-links\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mathias-lauber/\" class=\"about-link\" target=\"_blank\">🔗 LinkedIn</a>\n        <a href=\"mailto:mathias.lauber@outlook.com\" class=\"about-link\">✉ Email</a>\n        <a href=\"portfolio.html\" class=\"about-link\">📊 Portfolio</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ════════════════════════ CONTENT ════════════════════════════════ -->\n<div style=\"background: #0d1117;\">\n<div class=\"about-content\">\n\n  <!-- EXPERIENCE -->\n  <div class=\"section-label\">Experience</div>\n\n  <!-- WADA — current -->\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"tl-title\">Data &amp; Insights Analyst</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-org\">World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA)</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-period\">📅 March 2025 – Present</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-desc\">\n      <ul style=\"padding-left:1.2rem; margin:0;\">\n        <li>Interface between business users and data architects — identifying data needs and translating them into technical requirements</li>\n        <li>Building and maintaining ETL/ELT pipelines using Python, PySpark and Databricks</li>\n        <li>Creating scripts and automated jobs for data ingestion and refresh</li>\n        <li>Developing BI products: reports, semantic data models, schemas and data catalogs</li>\n        <li>Building interactive Streamlit applications for internal data access</li>\n        <li>Animating and growing the internal data community</li>\n        <li>Data analysis, machine learning and log / activity analysis</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"d-pills\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n      <span class=\"tag t-blue\">Python</span><span class=\"tag t-blue\">PySpark</span>\n      <span class=\"tag t-blue\">Databricks</span><span class=\"tag t-blue\">SQL</span>\n      <span class=\"tag t-blue\">ETL / ELT</span>\n      <span class=\"tag t-orange\">Streamlit</span><span class=\"tag t-orange\">Semantic Models</span>\n      <span class=\"tag t-pink\">ML</span><span class=\"tag t-yellow\">Data Community</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- FSO -->\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"tl-title\">Data Visualization Specialist</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-org\">Swiss Federal Statistical Office (FSO · OFS)</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-period\">📅 February 2023 – February 2025</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-desc\">\n      <ul style=\"padding-left:1.2rem; margin:0;\">\n        <li>Designing and coding interactive, dynamic visualizations for federal statistics publications</li>\n        <li>Optimizing visualization pipelines and processes (~9,000 assets/year)</li>\n        <li>Scrollytelling, interactive charts, maps and small multiples</li>\n        <li>Responsive design from mobile to wide screen</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"d-pills\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n      <span class=\"tag t-purple\">D3.js</span><span class=\"tag t-purple\">Datawrapper</span>\n      <span class=\"tag t-purple\">R / ggplot2</span><span class=\"tag t-purple\">Scrollytelling</span>\n      <span class=\"tag t-green\">GIS</span><span class=\"tag t-green\">Maps</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr style=\"border-color: #30363d; margin: 2.5rem 0;\">\n\n  <!-- EDUCATION -->\n  <div class=\"section-label\">Education</div>\n\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"tl-title\">Master of Science — Spatial Analysis &amp; Complex Systems</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-org\">University of Lausanne (UNIL)</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-period\">📅 2019 – 2022 · Geosciences and Environment</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-desc\">\n      Quantitative methods · Data wrangling &amp; visualization · Networks &amp; spatial modelling ·\n      Statistics · Sustainability assessments · Geodata &amp; mapping\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"tl-title\">Bachelor of Science — Geography</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-org\">University of Lausanne (UNIL)</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-period\">📅 2016 – 2019 · Geosciences and Environment</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr style=\"border-color: #30363d; margin: 2.5rem 0;\">\n\n  <!-- SKILLS -->\n  <div class=\"section-label\">Skills Overview</div>\n  <div class=\"tech-rows\">\n    <div class=\"tech-row\">\n      <span class=\"tech-label\">Languages</span>\n      <div class=\"tech-pills\"><span class=\"tp\">Python</span><span class=\"tp\">SQL</span><span class=\"tp\">R</span><span class=\"tp\">JavaScript</span><span class=\"tp\">HTML/CSS</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tech-row\">\n      <span class=\"tech-label\">Data Engineering</span>\n      <div class=\"tech-pills\"><span class=\"tp\">PySpark</span><span class=\"tp\">Databricks</span><span class=\"tp\">Apache Spark</span><span class=\"tp\">Delta Lake</span><span class=\"tp\">ETL/ELT</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tech-row\">\n      <span class=\"tech-label\">Visualization</span>\n      <div class=\"tech-pills\"><span class=\"tp\">D3.js</span><span class=\"tp\">Datawrapper</span><span class=\"tp\">ggplot2</span><span class=\"tp\">Streamlit</span><span class=\"tp\">Plotly</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tech-row\">\n      <span class=\"tech-label\">GIS</span>\n      <div class=\"tech-pills\"><span class=\"tp\">ArcGIS</span><span class=\"tp\">QGIS</span><span class=\"tp\">Leaflet</span><span class=\"tp\">GeoPandas</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tech-row\">\n      <span class=\"tech-label\">ML &amp; Analytics</span>\n      <div class=\"tech-pills\"><span class=\"tp\">Scikit-learn</span><span class=\"tp\">Pandas</span><span class=\"tp\">NumPy</span><span class=\"tp\">Statistics</span><span class=\"tp\">Log Analysis</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ════════════════════════ ABOUT HERO ═════════════════════════════ -->\n<section class=\"about-hero\">\n  <div class=\"about-grid\">\n\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"profile-img\" src=\"img/profile.jpg\" alt=\"Mathias Lauber\" onerror=\"this.outerHTML='<div class=\\'profile-placeholder\\'>👤</div>'\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"hero-badge\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">Data Professional · Switzerland</div>\n      <div class=\"about-name\">Mathias Lauber</div>\n      <div class=\"about-role\">Data &amp; Insights Analyst @ World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA)</div>\n      <p class=\"about-bio\">\n